-- The docking bay of Aurum 80 (ours, after the book's description, p. 80): shipping containers and booths in a maze,
-- repair shops, docking airlocks along the outer wall, the timer, the elevators up, the way to the plaza, and in
-- the south-west corner airlock 13C, almost hidden behind a heap of junk.

